    },
    {
      "task": "TASK-110",
      "criterion": "TASK-AC-2E6734369AC5, TASK-AC-9A47DF868BD4",
      "text": "The circuit's badge is format-only (`CIRCUIT`, was `CIRCUIT · 3 ROUNDS` outside the product presentation) and its prescribed rounds (`3 ROUNDS`) are read on the line under the header; under the product presentation Round 7 had dropped the rounds from the card before a round was recorded. The circuit-round state's card gains that one line."
    },
    {
      "task": "TASK-110",
      "criterion": "TASK-AC-4BEA11242321, AC-R003-03, TASK-AC-9A47DF868BD4",
      "text": "Each live row's name, compact equipment and prescribed load are `liveMovementReadings` (the load-guidance read model's target through `loadText`), drawn exactly as before. The prescription line carries `data-structure-meta` and, for an EMOM with a rest window, `Ns rest at the end of each minute` after its window; the cards state's EMOM prescribes no rest, so its line is unchanged."
    },
